  lines:
  - Inside the Bag are the medical records of all the expedition team members. Basic
    stuff about small injuries and mental sanity statuses. Except for the Geologist
    who has a note written about him.
  - "\u201CDoctor Bancroft takes his studies way too seriously. It\u2019s been very
    difficult for me to pull him away from that quarry. I am afraid he may injure
    himself if I don\u2019t keep an eye on him.\u201D"
  - "Well, it\u2019s worth a shot. Just need the frequency number..."
  - I wonder if there are any clues inside. There's that one box of stuff I could
    check.
  - ...It's getting dark. I should hurry.
  lineSFX: 1100000005000000000000000300000000000000
  flag: 8
